  "reasoning_summary": "Answers reflect a low-openness, introverted respondent with upper secondary education and mild math anxiety. Relationships emphasize structured exploration over abstract fluency, while step-by-step explanations prioritize concreteness. AI hints are cautious—acknowledging its potential without overpromising precision. Stationary points/quadratic formulas show comfort with applied algebra over theory, despite hesitation around higher-order concepts. PCA is framed as tool-like to mitigate anxiety, and LLM suggestions align with creativity-over-complexity trends in modern education."
